    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 112,
      "title": "CPU temp — current LED colour",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "pironman_influxdb"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "pironman_influxdb"
          },
          "query": "SELECT mean(\"cpu_temperature\") FROM \"history\" WHERE $timeFilter GROUP BY time($__interval) fill(previous)",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "resultFormat": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "celsius",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 45
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 52.5
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 57.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 62.5
              },
              {
                "color": "purple",
                "value": 65
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 113,
      "title": "LED colour legend",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "#### LED colour by CPU temperature\n| Temp (°C) | LED colour |\n|---|---|\n| < 45 | 🟢 **green** (cool) |\n| 45 – 52 | 🔵 **blue** (green→blue) |\n| 52 – 57 | 🟡 **yellow** |\n| 57 – 62 | 🟠 **orange** |\n| 62 – 65 | 🔴 **red** |\n| > 65 | 🟣 **purple — blinking ALARM** |\n\nBrightness rises with temperature. The number panel on the left is background-coloured with the colour the strip is currently showing."
      }
    },
